  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOWARDS HARMONISED REVENUE STATISTICS IN AFRICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action aims to provide a specific contribution to the Pan-African Statistics Programme (PAS-II). The Revenue Statistics in Africa initiative aims to: i) produce harmonised, comprehensive and timely data on tax and non-tax revenues; ii) strengthen the capacity of the African Statistical System (AfSS) to produce high-quality statistics; and iii) promote the use of revenue statistics to inform evidence-based analysis and policy-making) in the field of Revenue Statistics&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
